\ music.6502 - the front end's two tunes, title and high score, as the disassembly has them in
\ bank 5 at &9300-&A27F. Not assembled: tools/packmusic.py packs them (ZX02) into
\ src/music_packed.6502, which src/game.6502 (unpack_for_play) unpacks to &9300 at start-up.
\ Hand-maintained, as bank5.6502 was; the labels name the parts.

\ ;     c0 c2 c3 c1                                                   # &00 = no sound, &ff = silence, otherwise pitch
